	(text "VSYS SENSE — R23 in the harness at P4, R24 + Q4 on the carrier: GPIO37 low = VSYS present"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 411.48 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0d9c327d-42e5-5045-848c-60e965b1af49")
	)
	(text "U10: front hole at the top (right middle), R17 on P2; U7, U11 in the right leg (SQW not wired)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 356.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0e82934e-f639-5d33-9188-381e98ced3fc")
	)
	(text "U9: EN tied to VIN, PS/SYNC to GND (never drive it high). Its VSYS/GND pair leaves from the star; the logic GND to P1 leaves from its GND pad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 370.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1354eeab-ff97-5629-9803-ae808cb6eb74")
	)
	(text "C1 (SMD 7343 tantalum lying under the S3) on its carrier, C2 / C3 on the P1 3V3 strip, C10 / C11 on P2; plans renders/tars4_board_*.svg."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "23214901-041b-53f7-912c-c0f342198bea")
	)
	(text "LEDs: remove every status LED fed by the battery (ZS-042, TPS63020, GY-291, microSD reader…); keep the TP4056 charge LEDs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 386.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2e44bf37-b25b-5781-91bc-211a0508df07")
	)
	(text "R15 / R16: charger plugged in → USB_DET ≈ 3 V (GPIO21, wake-up)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "449fc25a-9b2c-53f5-bbc6-7cb6bedc2e33")
	)
	(text "S3: V (VBUS) = the S3 USB-C only. EN = S3 reset (≠ BL_EN). 33 Ω series at the S3 (R20 on MOSI); SCK split on the carrier: R12 → screen 1, R19 → screen 2 (direct wire in the tube), 47 Ω (up to 100 if the image jitters)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 375.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "53ab8f28-7de6-5496-9e01-e2147ff6de17")
	)
	(text "SOUND, MIC, microSD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 345.44 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "59816ea3-660c-55fb-ac6b-03e8c1f24825")
	)
	(text "BL_EN (GPIO7): backlight of both screens only (PWM possible). AMP_SD (GPIO4): R10 1k + R18 10k on P2 → amplifier SD (off at boot and in sleep). P1 / P2: stripboards under the screens. I2C chain: S3 → ADXL345 → middle tube → P2 → right tube → DS3231 + BME280 (right leg); sensor supply P1 → mic → ADXL345, P2 → right leg."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 381 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5e5c73bf-80bf-56b0-811f-c0ecab2a1a96")
	)
	(text "SCREENS, I2C SENSORS →"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.08 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "69ff1c98-4730-5301-8a65-41dbce4af549")
	)
	(text "VUSB (J1: micro-USB charging socket at the heel of the left leg; D3 + C9 on the TP4056 IN pads)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "86e95dc0-ba28-516a-a313-5884dffeeffd")
	)
	(text "Connectors X1–X15 (keyed Dupont / JST) between each module and the harness, S3 plugged into a carrier: not drawn, see tars4_wiring.html. D3: unidirectional TVS (Zener symbol). A crossing without a dot is not a connection. Generated by tools/kicad_sch_gen.py (netlist checked at every generation)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 396.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ca83ea45-f0f9-54ba-926d-2033360187ee")
	)
	(text "Silicone wire: power in 26 AWG (B+/B−, amplifier pair, 3V3 and GND to P1), signals and screen / sensor supply in 30 AWG. Tubes: 14 / 19 / 6 wires."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 391.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ceeb4840-6fe1-5fe7-b2c4-05ba1f1ce205")
	)
	(text "Q1 + D1 + R1: power path (mains / battery). R2 / R3 (1M, on B+: the real cell voltage, even on mains) on the power-path board; C6 (GPIO1) and C8 (GPIO21) at the S3 pins. Q5 + R22 on the power-path board: microSD cut in sleep (GPIO36 low = on)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 365.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d07842c5-75b3-5f2e-bc8c-d450647e5e2b")
	)
	(text "POWER — ground star on the power-path board (left leg)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d177a130-fafb-5293-812e-e9451ab36f58")
	)
	(text "BRAIN — LOLIN S3 Mini (left middle)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.92 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
